  "goodToKnow": "Die Umschulung is retraining for a new occupation, often for people who can't continue in their old job because of health or structural change. It usually takes two years and leads to a recognised qualification; die Agentur für Arbeit or the pension insurer often pays. Umschulen also means to move a child to another school. Die Weiterbildung is further training in the same field. Plural: die Umschulungen."
